    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/2b943ea131050555ee105ffd5e127ed7.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br>Lost in the depths of the universe, you don't know what to do to get out of here.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/625c0eeead7cca4de8063196e101bdd1.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br>Simple gameplay, challenging trails, if you fall down , try again. If you take the checkpoint you will spawn there. Its an adventure in the dark universe.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/c2dbf68974db576ab5707016fd4beeda.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to learn controls<br></li><li>Difficult parkours<br></li><li>26 main levels - The levels get harder as you progress.<br></li><li>Different designs<br></li><li>Different traps<br></li><li>100 achievements!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/2b943ea131050555ee105ffd5e127ed7.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br>Lost in the depths of the universe, you don't know what to do to get out of here.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/625c0eeead7cca4de8063196e101bdd1.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br>Simple gameplay, challenging trails, if you fall down , try again. If you take the checkpoint you will spawn there. Its an adventure in the dark universe.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1014590/extras/c2dbf68974db576ab5707016fd4beeda.avif?t=1614704508\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to learn controls<br></li><li>Difficult parkours<br></li><li>26 main levels - The levels get harder as you progress.<br></li><li>Different designs<br></li><li>Different traps<br></li><li>100 achievements!</li></ul>",
